SUMMARY:Hannah and Kat: Pretty Pretty Princess
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Hannah and Kat are at the Edinburgh Fringe and they've brought 
 their signature homemade semi-structurally sound princess hats. They are a 
 comedy double act formed in Bristol\, semi-finalists of the Leicester Squar
 e Sketch Off\, and actually surprisingly tall for their height. Watch their
  show as they learn to understand the world through interpretive dance\, Pa
 ul McCartney\, and a meditative retreat which may or may not be interrupted
  by a baboon… 'Utterly bizarre and completely silly' ***** (Epigram\, Bri
 stol). SO excited to see you!!!\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-
 atlas/event/hannah-and-kat-pretty-pretty-princess-27574/
